<title>FRANCE: Bouygues sees 96 turnover at 72.5 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Bouygues sees 96 turnover at 72.5 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bouygues said on Wednesday it expected turnover for the 1996 year to be 72.5 billion francs.</p>
<p>Including sales of the Saur unit, turnover should be 81.4 billion francs, it said in a financial advertisement.</p>
<p>Bouygues had 1995 turnover of 73,842 million francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452 pnt</p>
